<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 39 0 R/T(RideNRepair is India's leading Uber-style, door-to-door car and two-wheeler repair platform, connecting customers with vetted mechanics for on-demand service. Following its acquisition of its largest domestic competitor, Apna Cars, RideNRepair is now the category's sole major player in India. The engagement covered two workstreams: designing standard operating procedures for mechanic sourcing, onboarding, and certification to support seamless city-level expansion; and an analytics-driven overhaul of RideNRepair's spare parts strategy, shifting from third-party suppliers to direct OEM sourcing and a white-labeled parts business alongside early-stage research into international market expansion.)/E(RideNRepair is India's leading Uber-style, door-to-door car and two-wheeler repair platform, connecting customers with vetted mechanics for on-demand service. Following its acquisition of its largest domestic competitor, Apna Cars, RideNRepair is now the category's sole major player in India. The engagement covered two workstreams: designing standard operating procedures for mechanic sourcing, onboarding, and certification to support seamless city-level expansion; and an analytics-driven overhaul of RideNRepair's spare parts strategy, shifting from third-party suppliers to direct OEM sourcing and a white-labeled parts business alongside early-stage research into international market expansion.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[7]>>
