1019 0 obj
<</Title(We conducted market feasibility research for a Qatar-based venture evaluating entry into the learning-disabilities assistive-technology space. CCG assessed market attractiveness, benchmarked existing solutions, evaluated funding opportunities and translated a broad product vision into a phased, data-backed product roadmap, enabling leadership to make a go/no-go decision within a week.)/Dest[14 0 R/Fit]/Parent 975 0 R/Next 1055 0 R>>
endobj

